[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/104649035","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/6613#issuecomment-104649035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/6613","id":104649035,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDEwNDY0OTAzNQ==","user":{"login":"nchachereau","id":904912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDkxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/904912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau","html_url":"https://github.com/nchachereau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-05-22T12:33:55Z","updated_at":"2015-05-22T12:33:55Z","body":"The problem comes from using `isset()` which will return `false` whether the property is `null` or hasn't been defined.\n\nProposed fix: use `array_key_exists` instead:\n\nIn `getOriginal()`:\n\n``` diff\n-        if (isset($this->_original[$property])) {\n+        if (array_key_exists($property, $this->_original)) {\n             return $this->_original[$property];\n         }\n```\n\nIn `set()`:\n\n``` diff\n-            if (!isset($this->_original[$p]) &&\n-                isset($this->_properties[$p]) &&\n+            if (!array_key_exists($p, $this->_original) &&\n+                array_key_exists($p, $this->_properties) &&\n                 $this->_properties[$p] !== $value\n             ) {\n                 $this->_original[$p] = $this->_properties[$p];\n             }\n```\n\n(Please excuse me for not attaching an actual patch or even a merge request... this is (for me) much faster.)\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/104649035/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nchachereau","id":904912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDkxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/904912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau","html_url":"https://github.com/nchachereau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":311664440,"node_id":"MDE1Ok1pbGVzdG9uZWRFdmVudDMxMTY2NDQ0MA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/events/311664440","actor":{"login":"dereuromark","id":39854,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39854?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dereuromark","html_url":"https://github.com/dereuromark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dereuromark/followers","following_url":"https://a