fect","color":"f7c6c7"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/104651233","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/6613#issuecomment-104651233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/6613","id":104651233,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDEwNDY1MTIzMw==","user":{"login":"AD7six","id":33387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six","html_url":"https://github.com/AD7six","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-05-22T12:49:27Z","updated_at":"2015-05-22T12:49:27Z","body":"> this is (for me) much faster.\n\nI think this is a duplicate of other tickets or at least has come up before.\n\nThere aren't any test cases that appear to cover what you're describing, I suspect the proposed fix won't work _correctly_ in all cases owing to the way null is assumed to mean missing in other places, [such as this](https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/pull/6472/files).\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/104651233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"co