.github.com/users/nchachereau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-05-22T12:59:57Z","updated_at":"2015-05-22T12:59:57Z","body":"Thanks for this feedback. \n\nAs for the duplicate, I searched for other tickets before reporting. I'm pretty sure this hasn't come up yet.\n\nAs for the problems the fix might provoke, it could be, but I thought about the problem before suggesting this. At the very least, the code you link to will NOT be affected: extractOriginal() and extractOriginalChanged() simply continue behaving as they do now (that is, not reporting original null values - which might also surprise some users, btw.) As I pointed out, the fact that they test for getOriginal() possibly returning null values is a strong indicator that this is the expected behavior.\n\nAnd no, there are not any test cases on this yet. Which is partly why it was faster suggesting this patch instead of writing a formal PR.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/104653971/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nchachereau","id":904912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDkxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/904912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau","html_url":"https://github.com/nchachereau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nchachereau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gi